# Varka Silenos support (VarkaSilenosSupport): the village folk of a Varka Silenos ally of level 5, each first talk answering by the level.
# The ally buys the last blessing for 6 tokens (the soul guide's cast of it is in
# tests/quest/alliance_support_test.go: a scenario civilian has no MP to pay it), and finds the
# warehouse empty. Killing a soldier of the side then breaks the alliance: the level 5 badge
# becomes the level 4 one, the alliance mission ends with its item, and every folk answers a
# player of no alliance.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (VarkaSilenosSupport.onFirstTalk, onAdvEvent,
# onMyDying) and replay the reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/varka_support_ally_5.golden
character Ally 40
standing -5
hold 7225 1
hold 7187 6
hold 7226 3
quest Q611_AllianceWithVarkaSilenos <state>=STARTED <cond>=1
script quest.Q611_AllianceWithVarkaSilenos
script script.feature.VarkaSilenosSupport
item 7225 7224 7187 7226
page script/feature/VarkaSilenosSupport/
npc ashas 31377 Folk 10 0 0
npc naran 31378 Folk 0 10 0
npc udan 31379 Folk -10 0 0
npc diyabu 31380 Merchant 0 -10 0
npc hagos 31381 WarehouseKeeper 10 10 0
npc shikon 31382 Merchant -10 -10 0
npc teranu 31383 Gatekeeper 10 -10 0
npc recruit 21350 Monster 40 0 0

action ashas
action ashas
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=ashas item=0 page=script/feature/VarkaSilenosSupport/31377-friend.htm
  S ActionFailed
action naran
